        <tr><td>Trace-trained decoder (CWM class)</td><td>Next-token prediction plus execution traces and environment trajectories</td><td>A checker as acceptance. Traces are a learned stand-in for the transition</td><td>Tests are the oracle in that report. Trace prediction is called a "first step". A neural debugger is future work</td><td>H3, H10, and the trace-trained arm of H15. RJ-F6 is the falsifier if this class closes the residual with no use of the Form quotient</td></tr>
