        <tr><td>Large Concept Models</td><td>The next sentence embedding, not the next token</td><td>An exact acceptance step, which the abstract does not have</td><td>A concept there is a sentence. No code-specific result in the abstract</td><td>None of H1 to H15 until a code result exists</td></tr>
